{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"registries-for-ai-assistants","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Registries for AI assistants"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-command\">kirana-style</span> ui mcp","source":"kirana-style ui mcp"}},{"type":"text","value":" is a "},{"type":"link","href":"https://modelcontextprotocol.io","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Model Context Protocol"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\nserver for your project. An assistant that speaks the protocol can search your\nregistries, read what an item is and what its files hold, and get the command\nthat installs it, without you pasting any of it in."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"It runs over stdio from your project's directory, with the\n"},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"@kirana-style/registry","source":"@kirana-style/registry"}},{"type":"text","value":" package your project already has for\n"},{"type":"link","href":"/docs/tooling/components","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-command\">kirana-style</span> ui","source":"kirana-style ui"}}]},{"type":"text","value":". Tell your assistant the command:"}]},{"type":"component","name":"code","tagName":"md-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"source":"claude mcp add kirana -- npx kirana-style ui mcp   # Claude Code","lang":"bash","html":"<span class=\"th-token th-prompt\">$</span> <span class=\"th-token th-command\">claude</span> mcp add kirana -- npx kirana-style ui mcp   <span class=\"th-token th-comment\"># Claude Code</span>","variant":"terminal"}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Clients that read a JSON file of servers, such as "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":".mcp.json","source":".mcp.json"}},{"type":"text","value":" or Cursor's\n"},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":".<span class=\"th-token th-property\">cursor</span>/mcp.<span class=\"th-token th-property\">json</span>","source":".cursor/mcp.json"}},{"type":"text","value":", take the same command:"}]},{"type":"component","name":"code","tagName":"md-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"source":"{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"kirana\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [\"kirana-style\", \"ui\", \"mcp\"] }\n  }\n}","lang":"json","html":"{\n  <span class=\"th-token th-property\">&quot;mcpServers&quot;</span>: {\n    <span class=\"th-token th-property\">&quot;kirana&quot;</span>: { <span class=\"th-token th-property\">&quot;command&quot;</span>: <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;npx&quot;</span>, <span class=\"th-token th-property\">&quot;args&quot;</span>: [<span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;kirana-style&quot;</span>, <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;ui&quot;</span>, <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;mcp&quot;</span>] }\n  }\n}"}},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"its-tools","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Its tools"}]},{"type":"table","align":[null,null],"header":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Tool"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Gives"}]}],"rows":[[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"list_registries","source":"list_registries"}}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Your registries, each namespace and its URL, and the project's framework, base and icon library. A registry's headers stay out."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"search_items","source":"search_items"}}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The items whose name, title or description holds every word of a query, from every registry or those named, as "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"ui search","source":"ui search"}},{"type":"text","value":" does."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"view_items","source":"view_items"}}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"What each item is and what installing it brings, as "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"ui view","source":"ui view"}},{"type":"text","value":" prints it."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"get_item_files","source":"get_item_files"}}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"An item's files with their content, for your project's framework (or the one asked for) and every base, or the base asked for."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"get_add_command","source":"get_add_command"}}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-command\">kirana-style</span> ui add","source":"kirana-style ui add"}},{"type":"text","value":" command for those items, with your package manager."}]}]]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The server reads; it never writes to your project. To install, the assistant runs\nthe command "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"get_add_command","source":"get_add_command"}},{"type":"text","value":" gives, which writes files as "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"ui add","source":"ui add"}},{"type":"text","value":" always does:\nyour aliases, your icon library, the lockfile and the check after. Your\n"},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"kirana.<span class=\"th-token th-property\">config</span>","source":"kirana.config"}},{"type":"text","value":" is read again for every call, so a registry you add is seen at\nonce."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"It needs no package beyond "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"@kirana-style/registry","source":"@kirana-style/registry"}},{"type":"text","value":", and speaks the protocol's\nrevisions from 2024-11-05 on."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"registries-for-ai-assistants","text":"Registries for AI assistants","level":1},{"id":"its-tools","text":"Its tools","level":2}]}
